      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>what happens if the card deck is empty (so every card is in play/trash) ?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Would that mean I reshuffel the deck? Or jsut -&gt; Ok the Villian is out of \"special\" actions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Problem came up with the Chairman, we were lucky and had the Prison breakout at the beginning and could hold us alive over the time with Adept. And finally the card deck was empty :(&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We decided to reshuffel but I am not pretty sure &nbsp;(same with the enviroment deck)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks Vex</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:55.466Z",
