      "created_at": "2012-12-04T10:56:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You're right. When a deck is exhausted and you need to draw a card (not just reveal, you need to actually draw something) you shuffle the trash and proceed as normal. This applies to any deck, hero, villain or environment.</p>",
