      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/90ced4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-04T14:01:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks so far :) so there is a missing the rules?!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ok here the questions that belong to this:</p><p><br>Spite&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Game SETUP:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Put all Thugs into the trash</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SO - If I need to reshuffel - they still stay in the trash or will they count as Villian Deck?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks :)</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:18.263Z",
