      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Thanks so far :) so there is a missing the rules?!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ok here the questions that belong to this:</p><p><br />Spite&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Game SETUP:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Put all Thugs into the trash</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SO - If I need to reshuffel - they still stay in the trash or will they count as Villian Deck?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks :)</p>",
