      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-04T14:06:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That is The Chairman, not Spite, and anything in the setup portion only occurs at the start of the game.&nbsp; All thug cards are part of the deck, so when The Chairman needs to resuffle his trash to make a deck, the entire trash is shuffled to make a deck.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:18.341Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
