      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>That is The Chairman, not Spite, and anything in the setup portion only occurs at the start of the game.&nbsp; All thug cards are part of the deck, so when The Chairman needs to resuffle his trash to make a deck, the entire trash is shuffled to make a deck.</p>",
