    {
      "id": 47836,
      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-05T07:11:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can most certainly absorb more than two Underbosses with Savage Mana, and, in fact, it could be a decent enough strategy.&nbsp; The moment you use Savage Mana, those Underboss cards go in the trash, so The Chairman can flip then. Just make sure The Operative has been dealt with first.&nbsp; This will also protect against Prison Break as well.</p>",
